      "Clausius-Clapeyron Formula: \\ln\\left(\\frac{P_2}{P_1}\\right) = -\\frac{\\Delta H_{vap}}{R}\\left(\\frac{1}{T_2} - \\frac{1}{T_1}\\right).",
      "Gibbs Phase Rule: F = C - P + 2.",
