      "17 UN SDGs Horizon: Target year 2030.",
      "Ozone Catalytic Destruction: A single chlorine radical destroys over 100,000 ozone molecules.",
      "Montreal Protocol Success: Most successful environmental treaty; phased out CFCs and halons.",
      "Paris Climate Target: Limit global warming to well below 2°C, preferably 1.5°C above pre-industrial levels.",
      "Environment Protection Act 1986: Enacted under Article 253 as an umbrella framework following the 1984 Bhopal Gas Tragedy.",
      "Indian Constitutional Mandates: Article 48A (State's duty) and Article 51A(g) (Citizen's fundamental duty).",
      "National Green Tribunal (NGT): Established in 2010 for fast-track judicial resolution of environmental disputes.",
      "EIA Public Hearing: Mandatory democratic stage allowing project-affected local communities to voice environmental and rehabilitation objections.",
      "GRIHA Rating System: National green building rating system in India developed by TERI and MNRE.",
